When they find out in branch closing that, you know, Scranton is going to be, you know, closed down, he goes up to Jim at the Stanford office and goes, in your face!
当分公司关闭时，他们发现，你知道，斯克兰顿要，你知道，被关闭了，他走到斯坦福办公室的吉姆面前说，活该！

