00:32:51.360 --> 00:32:52.300
But anyway, I'm so sorry.
但不管怎样，非常抱歉。

762
00:32:52.440 --> 00:32:53.960
So, so Ed, obviously.
所以，埃德，显而易见。

763
00:32:54.140 --> 00:32:55.460
Ed is like, cast that guy.
埃德就像是，选定那个家伙。

764
00:32:55.600 --> 00:32:56.040
He's great.
他太棒了。

765
00:32:56.280 --> 00:32:57.340
He's a New England preppy.
他是个新英格兰预科生。

766
00:32:57.800 --> 00:33:01.920
Like, I was delighted because Andy Brown is everyone I grew up with in Connecticut.
就像，我很高兴，因为安迪·布朗就是我在康涅狄格州一起长大的所有人。

767
00:33:01.920 --> 00:33:04.560
Like, I was like, oh, I can write this guy forever.
就像，我在想，哦，我可以一直写这个家伙。

768
00:33:04.840 --> 00:33:08.340
Like, I'm giving, like, wind me up and set me loose.
就像，我感觉，就像是，上紧发条然后放手去干。

769
00:33:08.720 --> 00:33:18.140
The hardest part was Rashida because this is one of the hardest things to do in any show, right, is there are two people on the show who are soulmates.
最难的部分是拉什达，因为这是任何节目中最难的事情之一，对吧，节目里有两个灵魂伴侣。

