00:33:57.460 --> 00:34:05.160
He either cheats on him or browbeats him or is, like, selfish or is mean or whatever, and it's cheap because it makes the audience just, like,
要么对主角不忠，要么对主角颐指气使，或者很自私、刻薄之类，这很低级，因为这只会让观众，

