00:34:58.880 --> 00:34:59.660
and be ready for him.
做好准备迎接他。

802
00:34:59.840 --> 00:35:06.500
So what Sherman did, according to Greg, was to drive his army halfway between two possible
所以根据格雷غ的说法，谢尔曼的做法是把军队开到两个可能目的地

