00:35:32.920 --> 00:35:35.440
to say, I'm sorry, Pam, you missed your shot.
对帕姆说：“对不起，帕姆，你错失良机了。”

810
00:35:35.620 --> 00:35:39.380
And half of the audience is rooting for him to say, like, get rid of this lady and go with
而另一半观众则支持他对帕姆说：

811
00:35:39.380 --> 00:35:39.700
Pam.
“甩了这个女人，跟帕姆在一起吧。”

812
00:35:39.700 --> 00:35:42.720
