00:36:10.480 --> 00:36:14.320
And so I was obviously like quietly being like, cast Rashida.
所以我当时显然就在心里默默地想：选拉什达吧。

821
00:36:14.620 --> 00:36:14.960
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
对，对，对。

822
00:36:15.160 --> 00:36:16.660
And then she had met John already.
而且她之前就已经见过约翰了。

823
00:36:16.840 --> 00:36:18.920
And so John liked her and was like pushing for her.
所以约翰挺喜欢她，也在力荐她。

824
00:36:19.140 --> 00:36:26.340
But Greg famously indecisive in these moments, or I guess the indecisive is not the nicest
但格雷格在那种时候出了名的优柔寡断，或者说，“优柔寡断”可能不是最委婉的

