00:36:26.340 --> 00:36:26.900
way to say it.
说法。

826
00:36:27.120 --> 00:36:31.740
Thorough would be the nicest way to put it, that he exhausts every avenue of possibility.
用最委婉的话来说就是“周到”，他会穷尽所有可能的途径。

827
00:36:31.740 --> 00:36:35.080
And we looked and looked and looked and eventually settled on Rashida.
我们找了又找，看了又看，最终还是定了拉什达。

