sweet little backstory, you know?
非常暖心的小背景故事，对吧？

969
00:44:35.000 --> 00:44:35.780
Oh, yeah.
哦，对。

970
00:44:36.080 --> 00:44:36.960
I love that.
我太喜欢那个了。

971
00:44:37.100 --> 00:44:37.280
Yeah.
对。

972
00:44:37.380 --> 00:44:38.460
That one was really fun.
那个真的很有趣。

973
00:44:38.460 --> 00:44:42.500
And I was so happy that it was supersized because it allowed us to keep all that stuff in the
我很庆幸这一集是超长版，因为这让我们得以把所有这些情节都保留在

974
00:44:42.500 --> 00:44:42.900
episode.
剧集里。

975
00:44:43.140 --> 00:44:43.360
Yeah.
对。

976
00:44:44.100 --> 00:44:45.080
Oh my gosh.
哦天哪。

