如何与演员合作等等所有的一切。

983
00:45:06.260 --> 00:45:09.160
Like it was such a vibrant laboratory is how I think about it.
我觉得它就像是一个充满活力的实验室。

984
00:45:09.280 --> 00:45:13.240
Like Greg threw us into the deep end of the pool in the best way.
格雷格就像是用最好的方式把我们直接扔进了深水区。

985
00:45:13.240 --> 00:45:14.940
You know, I'd never written on anything before.
要知道，我以前从来没有写过任何东西。

986
00:45:15.140 --> 00:45:19.840
And there I was like on the set, like dealing with directors and talking to actors and like
而当时我就在片场，和导演打交道，跟演员沟通，

