不仅仅是我自己的表演，因为他把我们带进了剪辑室、对话环节

1005
00:46:29.520 --> 00:46:30.960
and into the writer's room.
以及编剧房间。

1006
00:46:31.160 --> 00:46:37.680
And so seeing how a story was crafted and why it was important and like little things,
